jlKc3dZdV9DdXNnTTVNN1VzYlNrM0tNLUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":""},{"title":"Equinix donates $25K to Sterling Middle School reading initiative","src":"Loudoun Times","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":""},{"title":"Equinix launches liquid cooling centers for AI infrastructure testing","src":"W.Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNcUN5LW5uTkZ2WXBsdTFzVXZyVVJObTJuLVQ5RGpoNE95c2FOX2RrMXJpZlZsWFJnZWZHS1h4Yk9mX2RWaXlJa1Azay1TRUdQd2t4TU9rMlB3UXMzMTE5NGRCZ0o1aTE0SDhaalQxZ1RyU0t0aXlwWlE5ek9aVzZkZ2hZZ0lxSjNXTTNRMjF4Yw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Equinix 推出 AI 基礎設施測試的液體冷卻中心"},{"title":"Equinix opens liquid-cooling test centres in five cities","src":"Telecompaper","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNZlg5WTFXMXQtb2FHZm5vS0pGUmlOM0lDdUtGNDdyRmtEeDBwQUVGNVhaaGVRV1lITmQzT1hOVVhMQTM5WGFDNGZLNU9Ud042bTg4Q3dpNEI5VVFDLVluTVdHQ2lMMXFRa0ZaajAwR1VVNV8zX0hsNzVEREhNbnVaSnJEbUJDa2tqYXRCdnk5WFJ2RXBUdVRtdlRuZHFDcmpV?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Equinix 在五個城市開設液冷測試中心"},{"title":"Equinix (NASDAQ:EQIX) Stock Moved Up to Strong-Buy by Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Equinix （納斯達克股票代碼：EQIX）股票被加拿大帝國商業銀行上調至強力買入"},{"title":"13,781 Equinix, Inc. $EQIX Shares Sold by Robeco Institutional Asset Management B.V.","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":""},{"title":"STULZ offers full-stack cooling for high-density AI data centers","src":"ET Datacenters","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":4},{"name":"資料中心","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1101239/000110123926000032/eqix-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Equinix (Nasdaq: EQIX) is the world's digital infrastructure company, shortening the path to boundless connectivity anywhere in the world to enable the innovations that enrich our work, life and planet. Equinix combines a global footprint of International Business ExchangeTM (IBX ) and xScaleTM data centers in the Americas, Asia-Pacific, and Europe, the Middle East and Africa (\"EMEA\") regions, infrastructure and interconnection offerings, and digital ecosystems required to serve a large and diverse set of customers around the world.","zh":"Equinix（納斯達克股票代碼：EQIX）是一家全球數位基礎設施公司，致力於縮短世界各地無限連接的路徑，以實現豐富我們的工作、生活和地球的創新。 Equinix 結合了遍布全球的 International Business Exchange™ (IBX) 和位於美洲、亞太地區以及歐洲、中東和非洲 (“EMEA”) 地區的 xScale™ 資料中心、基礎設施和互連產品以及為全球大量多元化客戶提供服務所需的數位生態系統。"},{"en":"Equinix was incorporated on June 22, 1998 as a Delaware corporation and operates as a REIT for federal income tax purposes. Since our inception, Equinix has been a network-neutral, multi-tenant data center (\"MTDC\") provider, where competing networks could connect and share data traffic to help scale the rapid growth of the early internet. The company's name, Equinix (composed from the words \"equality,\" \"neutrality\" and \"internet exchange\"), reflects that vision. The founders believed they not only had the opportunity, but also the responsibility, to create a company that would be the steward of some of the most important digital infrastructure assets in the world. Twenty-seven years later, we have expanded upon that vision by connecting economies, countries, enterprises and communities with seamless digital experiences, including cutting-edge artificial intelligence (\"AI\").","zh":"Equinix 成立於 1998 年 6 月 22 日，是一家特拉華州公司，並作為聯邦所得稅目的的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT) 運營。自成立以來，Equinix 一直是網路中立的多租戶資料中心 (“MTDC”) 供應商，競爭網路可以連接和共享資料流量，以幫助擴大早期互聯網的快速成長。該公司的名稱 Equinix（由“平等”、“中立”和“互聯網交換”等詞組成）反映了這一願景。創辦人相信，他們不僅有機會，而且有責任創建一家公司，管理世界上一些最重要的數位基礎設施資產。二十七年後，我們透過將經濟體、國家、企業和社區與包括尖端人工智慧（「AI」）在內的無縫數位體驗連結起來，進一步擴展了這個願景。"},{"en":"Our data centers around the world allow our customers to bring together and interconnect the infrastructure they need to seamlessly operate their business. With Equinix, they can scale with speed and agility, accelerate the launch of new digital offerings while safeguarding data, and implement AI applications at scale to achieve business success. We enable customers to simplify their digital infrastructure, ensure interoperability across platforms, and maximize speed, efficiency and security to deliver superior customer, partner and employee experiences. As more customers choose Equinix for high connectivity and performance reliability at the metro edge, it benefits their suppliers and business partners to colocate in the same data centers and connect directly with each other. This adjacency creates a network effect that attracts new customers while continuously enhancing our value propo","zh":"我們遍布世界各地的資料中心使我們的客戶能夠整合和互連無縫運營業務所需的基礎設施。借助 Equinix，他們可以快速靈活地擴展規模，在保護資料的同時加快新數位產品的推出，並大規模實施 AI 應用程式以實現業務成功。我們協助客戶簡化其數位基礎設施，確保跨平台的互通性，並最大限度地提高速度、效率和安全性，從而提供卓越的客戶、合作夥伴和員工體驗。隨著越來越多的客戶選擇 Equinix 在城域邊緣實現高連接性和效能可靠性，他們的供應商和業務合作夥伴可以在同一資料中心內託管並直接相互連接，從而受益匪淺。這種鄰近性創造了一種網路效應，可以吸引新客戶，同時不斷增強我們的價值主張"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers include telecommunications carriers, mobile and other network services providers, cloud and IT services providers, digital media and content providers, financial services companies, and global enterprise","zh":"我們的客戶包括電信業者、行動和其他網路服務供應商、雲端和 IT 服務供應商、數位媒體和內容供應商、金融服務公司和全球企業"},{"en":"ecosystems in various industries. We provide each company with access to a choice of business partners and solutions based on their colocation, interconnection and managed IT service needs, and we delivered 99.9999%+ operational uptime across our global data centers during the year ended December 31, 2025. As of December 31, 2025, we had over 10,500 customers worldwide. No one customer made up 10% or more of our total business revenues for the year ended December 31, 2025.","zh":"各行業的生態系。我們根據每家公司的託管、互連和託管 IT 服務需求，為他們提供選擇業務合作夥伴和解決方案的機會，並且在截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的年度內，我們的全球資料中心實現了 99.9999% 以上的正常運行時間。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在全球擁有超過 10,500 家客戶。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，沒有任何客戶占我們總業務收入的 10% 或以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"While a large number of enterprises and service providers, such as hyperscale cloud service providers, own their own data centers, we believe enterprises are shifting away from single-tenant solutions toward those that enable customers to outsource some or all of their IT infrastructure and interconnection requirements to third-party facilities, such as those operated by Equinix. This shift is being accelerated by the proliferation of hybrid multi-cloud architectures and the adoption of AI.","zh":"雖然大量企業和服務供應商（例如超大規模雲端服務供應商）擁有自己的資料中心，但我們相信企業正在從單一租戶解決方案轉向那些使客戶能夠將其部分或全部 IT 基礎設施和互連需求外包給第三方設施（例如 Equinix 營運的設施）的解決方案。混合多雲架構的激增和人工智慧的採用正在加速這種轉變。"},{"en":"Historically, the outsourcing market was served by large telecommunications carriers that bundled their products and services with their colocation offerings. The data center market landscape has since evolved to include private and carrier-neutral multi-tenant data centers, public and private cloud providers, managed infrastructure and application hosting providers, large hyperscale cloud providers and systems integrators. As a result, the global MTDC market is large and remains highly fragmented—with significant long-term growth opportunities for providers that can bundle various colocation, interconnection and network offerings, outsourced IT infrastructure solutions and managed services.","zh":"從歷史上看，外包市場由大型電信營運商提供服務，這些營運商將其產品和服務與其託管產品捆綁在一起。此後，資料中心市場格局不斷發展，包括私有和營運商中立的多租戶資料中心、公有和私有雲供應商、託管基礎設施和應用程式託管供應商、大型超大規模雲端供應商和系統整合商。因此，全球 MTDC 市場規模龐大且高度分散，對於能夠捆綁各種主機託管、互連和網路產品、外包 IT 基礎設施解決方案和託管服務的供應商來說，擁有巨大的長期成長機會。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":4111000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":3130000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1976000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":9217000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Recurring Revenues","val":8739000000,"zh":"經常性收入"},{"name":"Colocation","val":6475000000,"zh":"主機託管"},{"name":"Interconnection","val":1655000000,"zh":"互連"},{"name":"Non Recurring Revenues","val":478000000,"zh":"非經常性收入"},{"name":"Managed Infrastructure","val":466000000,"zh":"託管基礎設施"},{"name":"Other","val":143000000,"zh":"其他"}],"total":9217000000}},"peers":["DLR","PLD","AMT","CCI","SBAC"]}}